NOW THEREFORE, my Client, through me, calls upon you to, within 15 (fifteen) days of receipt of this notice:

(a) pay to my Client the sum of Rs. 70,00,000/- (Rupees Seventy Lakh only) towards outstanding certified dues under the said Agreement;

(b) pay to my Client contractual interest at 12% (twelve percent) per annum on the said sum from the respective due dates of certification till the date of actual realisation, in terms of Clause [NUMBER OF INTEREST CLAUSE] of the said Agreement;

(c) pay to my Client damages for breach of the said Agreement, quantified and particularised in the statement of claim to be filed in the arbitral proceedings invoked hereunder;

(d) pay to my Client a sum of Rs. 25,000/- (Rupees Twenty Five Thousand only) towards the cost of this legal notice; and

(e) confirm, in writing, your concurrence to the appointment of the arbitrator as proposed above, or make your nomination in terms of the arbitration clause.
